    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER ARE EAGER TO BRING TO THE MARKET THIS DETACHED 3 BEDROOM BUNGALOW ON AN EXCEPTIONAL 1.03 ACRE SITE ONLY 2KM FROM KELLS TOWN."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 8.6m x 2.2m\n\n\nSitting Room - 6.4m x 4.2m\n\n\nKitchen/dining room - 8.6m x 4.3m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.4m x 1.4m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1m x 3.0m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 3.0m x 1.0m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 3.0m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 3.0m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.2m x 2.0m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> This is a charming detached bungalow, situated on a generous 1.03-acre plot in the picturesque countryside in the outskirts of Kells town</li><li> The property offers a perfect blend of rural tranquillity and convenient living.</li><li> With a spacious layout of approximately 134 sq m, the property comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, a welcoming reception room, and two bathrooms, making it ideal for families or those seeking comfortable single-storey living.</li><li> The property is perfectly located just off the Kells/Athboy road and only 2 km from Kells town.</li><li> The dwelling is also a short drive to the Main M3 motorway to Dublin City with a commuting time of under 1 hours drive.</li><li> The bungalow is well lit throughout, creating a bright and airy atmosphere.</li><li> Set in a scenic rural location, it benefits from beautiful surrounding views, enhancing the peaceful rural lifestyle on offer.</li><li> Practical features include a sizeable garden, off-street parking, and a garage, providing ample space for vehicles and storage.</li><li> Detached Garage</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Septic tank sewerage</li><li> The property was originally constructed in 1920 but has been extended and modernised over the years.</li><li> Accessible yet affordable, this property presents a unique opportunity for those looking to enjoy countryside living without sacrificing convenience.</li><li> With excellent road links nearby, local amenities and services are within easy reach. This delightful home is ready to welcome its new owners seeking a serene and comfortable rural retreat.</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F\nBER No: 119728822\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
